# For more info on HTTP files go to https://aka.ms/vs/httpfile
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7199/

### Approve a nonexistent order
POST {{baseUrl}}api/orders/999999/approve
Accept: application/problem+json

### Test supplied correlation ID
POST {{baseUrl}}api/orders/1/approve
X-Correlation-ID: training-test-001

### Test generated correlation ID
POST {{baseUrl}}api/orders/1/approve

### Test correlation ID on error response
POST {{baseUrl}}api/orders/999999/approve
X-Correlation-ID: training-error-001